\caption(Explicit compact-model Adam fits, retaining every block. Training uses independent crop/flip augmentation and batch BN moments; inference validation selects paired parameter/moving-state checkpoints. Test subsets are used only after selection.)
\alttext(Explicit compact-model Adam fits, retaining every block. Training uses independent crop/flip augmentation and batch BN moments; inference validation selects paired parameter/moving-state checkpoints. Test subsets are used only after selection.)


Validation selects epochs two and three for ResNet-18/34. Their selected inference
training NLLs are 2.009575/2.092414, while test NLLs are 2.291547/2.293636 and
accuracies are 25%/15.625%. Training losses keep falling over the remaining epochs of
the 6-epoch run while validation does not improve; the validation-selected pair is restored
before testing.

